#: ../../source/docs/loiter-mode.rst:5 90097d7a466f4a79abb7f8448e297c90
msgid "Loiter Mode"
msgstr "Loiter 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-mode.rst:10 010f5c6aa34c4ff586a49c935e93966d
msgid "Loiter mode allows boats to hold position in a strong current."
msgstr "Loiter 模式允许船在强水流中保持定点位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-mode.rst:12 ece76c55f9274008b36a29df2feccfd6
msgid "The way this mode works is:"
msgstr "该模式的工作原理如下："

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-mode.rst:14 1f2059c8b1fc427488c3cec0d9ef719c
msgid ""
"the user switches into Loiter mode and the vehicle’s current position, "
"velocity and maximum deceleration are used to project a reasonable stopping "
"point"
msgstr "用户切换至 Loiter 模式，系统利用车辆当前位置、速度和最大减速度推算出一个合理的停止点"

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-mode.rst:15 f04901585ebb4e85959c3bf1cf1de148
msgid ""
"while the boat is within the :ref:`LOIT_RADIUS<LOIT_RADIUS>` of the target "
"it simply drifts"
msgstr "当船在目标点 :ref:`LOIT_RADIUS<LOIT_RADIUS>` 范围内时，直接随波漂浮"

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-mode.rst:16 999a4a37695e44debc55bace1deda5b0
msgid ""
"if/when the boat strays more than :ref:`LOIT_RADIUS<LOIT_RADIUS>` from the "
"target it:"
msgstr "当船偏离目标点超过 :ref:`LOIT_RADIUS<LOIT_RADIUS>` 时，将会："

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-mode.rst:18 956309d35c284dbf8e6c7cad5a4e0ae0
msgid ""
"rotates to point either directly towards the target or directly away from it"
" (whichever results in less rotation)"
msgstr "旋转至直接朝向目标或直接背向目标（以旋转量较小的方向为准）"

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-mode.rst:19 b30340f42618418890798e78c834f7d2
msgid ""
"drives/floats forwards or backwards at 0.5 m/s * the distance to the edge of"
" the circle around the target, but at a speed no greater than "
":ref:`WP_SPEED<WP_SPEED>`."
msgstr "以 0.5 m/s 乘以距目标圆周边缘距离的速度向前或向后行驶/漂行，但速度不超过 :ref:`WP_SPEED<WP_SPEED>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-mode.rst:24 4dc33d64f7104de8b1b805bf6cd585b9
msgid ""
"In order to obtain the optimum performance, the ESC deadband should be "
"small. The :ref:`MOT_THR_MIN<MOT_THR_MIN>` can be used to compensate for ESC"
" deadband. See this :ref:`section<rover-motor-and-servo-min-throttle>` for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"为获得最佳性能，电调死区应尽量小。可使用 :ref:`MOT_THR_MIN<MOT_THR_MIN>` 来补偿电调死区。详情请参见 :ref:`本节 "
"<rover-motor-and-servo-min-throttle>`。"
